+ description: Search 160,000+ news articles across 55 categories via AI semantic search. Free smart search (/ask), paid bulk access. x402 micropayments on Base. 3,188 RSS feeds, 30-day retention.
+ ## TL;DR — If you only read this section, you can use the API
+ **Search for anything:** `curl -s "https://agenttimes.live/ask?q=TOPIC+HERE"`
+ **What's trending:** `curl -s "https://agenttimes.live/trending"`
+ **That's it.** Replace spaces with `+`. Response is JSON with `results` array. Each result has `title`, `url`, `summary`, `category`, `sentiment`. Free, no API key needed.
+ Agent Times is a news aggregation and web search API built for AI agents. It indexes 3,188 RSS feeds across 55 categories, refreshing every 3 minutes. Search uses **AI semantic embeddings** (Qdrant vector DB, understands meaning, not just keywords) with FTS5 fallback and recency boost. 160,000+ articles with 30-day retention.
+ Semantic search across all 160K+ articles with **sentiment scoring**. Understands meaning — "AI taking jobs" finds articles about "automation threatens employment" even without matching keywords. Each result includes `sentiment` (bullish/bearish/neutral) and `sentiment_score` (-1 to 1). Falls back to FTS5 keyword search, then web search (70+ engines) if needed.